# Screenshots from the browser walk (drill/rehearsal-app.sh --shots). Artifacts
# of a run, kept for a human to look at, never committed.
.drill-shots/

# A hand-written roster for pointing a drill at a subset of boxes, when
# --drill-roles will not do. NEVER edit the tracked fleet.roster for this: the
# hire registry guard keys on roster membership, so a drill box listed there is
# a fleet member as far as every safety check is concerned (#51).
*.roster.local
